---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { SITE } from '../data/site';
---

<Base title="About" description="Covenant Living makes gospel-centered printables for families, missionaries, and Primary leaders.">
  <section class="read section prose">
    <p class="eyebrow">About</p>
    <h1>Hi, I'm Sarah</h1>
    <!-- DRAFT: replace with your story in your own words. Keep it to 3–5 short paragraphs. -->
    <p>
      I'm Sarah, the maker behind Covenant Living, based in St. George, Utah. I design
      printables that make it easier to bring the gospel into everyday life: Come Follow Me helps for families,
      keepsakes for missionary moms, and ready-to-use resources for Primary leaders.
    </p>
    <p>[Your story: why you started Covenant Living and who you make it for.]</p>
    <p>
      Every printable is an instant download through my <a href={SITE.etsyShopUrl} target="_blank" rel="noopener">Etsy shop</a>,
      and the blog shares ideas you can use even if you never buy a thing.
    </p>
    <hr class="divider" />
    <p><a class="btn" href="/free-printable/">Get a free printable</a></p>
  </section>
</Base>
